  "html": "\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/file_4.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"28\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:142/28\" width=\"142\"></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>UOnav </b></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010124083200/http://forg.co.kr:80/files/UONav.exe\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/file_3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:15/15\" width=\"15\"></b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">(배타실 때 멀미하시는분,항해가 순조로와집니다)</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>UOmon </b></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010124083200/http://forg.co.kr:80/files/uomon.zip\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/file_3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:15/15\" width=\"15\"></b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">(레어를 구하실 때 서버가 뜨는지 감시할수잇는프로그램입니다)</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>Mirc58t </b></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010124083200/http://forg.co.kr:80/files/mirc58t.exe\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/file_3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:15/15\" width=\"15\"></b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">(채팅프로그램입니다:irc.nuri.net접속)</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>Uoloop</b></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010124083200/http://forg.co.kr:80/files/uoloop.exe\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/file_3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:15/15\" width=\"15\"></b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">유오루프 프로그램</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>알집(압축프로그램)</b></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010124083200/http://forg.co.kr:80/files/alzip.exe\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/file_3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:15/15\" width=\"15\"></b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Arj,Ace,Zip,Rar등 거의모든 압축프로그램을 풀수잇는 프로그램입니다(물론 \n한글이고여-\"-)</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>Uosu</b></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010124083200/http://forg.co.kr:80/files/uosu133.zip\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/file_3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:15/15\" width=\"15\"></b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">울온 사진찍는 프로그램</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>GMouse</b></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010124083200/http://forg.co.kr:80/files/Gmouse20.zip\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/file_3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:15/15\" width=\"15\"></b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">고스트 마우스입니다</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>UOTrace</b></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010124083200/http://forg.co.kr:80/files/Uotarce.zip\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/file_3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:15/15\" width=\"15\"></b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">울온 핑검사 프로그램</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>울온전체지도</b></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010124083200/http://forg.co.kr:80/files/uo.zip\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/Image/file_3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:15/15\" width=\"15\"></b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">아주큰^^ 울온 세계지도입니다</font></p>\n",
